{"t":{"NORA (Baltijos Brasta)":"<p><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/nora.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" width=\"108\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/nora.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" width=\"92\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/nora_sh1.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img height=\"110\" width=\"104\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/nora_sh2.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></p>","NORA PLUS (Baltijos Brasta)":"<p><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/nora+.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" width=\"108\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/nora+.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/nora+sh1.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" width=\"100\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/nora+sh1.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/nora+sh2.jpg\"><img height=\"110\" width=\"107\" border=\"0\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/nora+sh2.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a></p>","RASA (Baltijos Brasta)":"<p><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/rasa.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"112\" width=\"110\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/rasa.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/rasa_1.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" width=\"88\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/rasa_1.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"104\" width=\"110\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/rasa_2.jpg\" alt=\"\" />Balti krāsots vai pelēki anodēts alumīnija profils, dro&scaron;s 6mm rūdīts stikls</p>","LAIMA (Baltijos Brasta)":"<p><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/laima.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" width=\"71\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" alt=\"\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/laima.jpg\" /></a><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/laima_1.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" width=\"95\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" alt=\"\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/laima_1.jpg\" /></a>Paredzēta pla&scaron;ām vannas istabām.<a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/laima_sh.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"89\" width=\"110\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/laima_sh.jpg\" /></a></p>","LIEPA (Baltijos Brasta)":"<p><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/liepa.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" width=\"108\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/liepa.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/liepa_1.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" width=\"100\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/liepa_1.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a>Du&scaron;as kabīnes LIEPA durvis atveramas gan uz ārpusi, gan iek&scaron;pusi.<a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/liepa_2.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"104\" width=\"110\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/liepa_2.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a></p>","VIKTORIJA (Baltijos Brasta)":"<p>D<a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/viktorija.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" width=\"71\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/viktorija.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"91\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" width=\"91\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/viktorija_sh.jpg\" alt=\"\" />u&scaron;as kabīnes durvis atveras gan uz iek&scaron;pusi, gan ārpusi.</p>\r\n<p>Kabīnes augstums 1.9m.</p>","TWIN Dušas kabīne":"<p><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/sserv/twin.png\"><img width=\"126\" hspace=\"5\" height=\"130\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/sserv/twin.png\" alt=\"\" /></a>Modulis durvis + durvis.</p>\r\n<p>Du&scaron;as kabīne tiek komplektēta atsevi&scaron;ķi no divām du&scaron;as durvīm. Iespējams kombinēt dažādu izmēru durvis.<br />\r\nKomplektācijā ietilpst divas du&scaron;as durvis ar lifta mehānismu, magnētiskā blīvgumija, hromēti apaļi rokturi.</p>\r\n<p>Augstums 1900mm</p>\r\n<p>Platums 800 un 900mm<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>","Andres Dušas kabīne":"<p><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/sserv/Andres1.png\"><img width=\"69\" hspace=\"5\" height=\"130\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/sserv/Andres1.png\" alt=\"\" /></a>Modulis <strong>durvis + siena</strong></p>\r\n<p>Augstums 1900mm</p>","KRISTINA (BALTIJOS BRASTA) Dušas kabīne":"<p><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/kristina.jpg\" width=\"87\" height=\"130\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" alt=\"\" />&nbsp;<img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/Kristina_sch.jpg\" width=\"130\" height=\"114\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify;\">Viegli montējama un ekspluatējama taisnstūrveida du&scaron;as kabīne ar minimālisma stilu. Viegli tīrāma.</span></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Kabines augstums (mm) 1900</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128);\">Stikls:&nbsp;Caurspīdīgs, Tonēts pelēks vai brūns, Matēts</span></p>\r\n<div style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Dusas kabīnes &quot;KRISTINA&quot; durvis var montēt gan labajā, gan kreisajā kabīnes pusē (iznemot&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">kabines ar matētu stiklu).</span></div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128);\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Pasūtot kabīni ar matētu stiklu noteikti norādiet,&nbsp; kurā pusē -&nbsp; kreisajā vai labajā, tiks montētas durvis</span></span></p>","BONA (Baltijos Brasta)":"<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/BONA.png\" width=\"87\" height=\"130\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/bonos_schema.png\" width=\"130\" height=\"76\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"\" />Minimalistisks, tapec skaisti iederesies pie visdazadakajam vannasistabas apdarem</span></p>","KARINA (Baltijos Brasta)":"<p><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/karina_scema.jpg\" width=\"130\" height=\"94\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"\" />&nbsp;<img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/karina.jpg\" width=\"87\" height=\"130\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; text-align: center;\">Viegli montējama un ekspluatējama taisnstūra du&scaron;as kabīne. Viegli tīrīt.</span></p>\r\n<div style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Du&scaron;as kabīnes &bdquo;Karina&quot; durvis var montēt gan labajā, gan kreisajā kabīnes pusē (izņemot kabīnes ar matētu stiklu).</span></div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Pasūtot kabīni ar matētu stiklu, noteikti norādiet, kurā pusē &ndash; kreisajā vai labajā, tiks montētas durvis.</span></div>","SIMA  (Baltijos Brasta)":"<p><span style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/sima.jpg\" width=\"87\" height=\"130\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" alt=\"\" />Bezrāmja taisnstūra du&scaron;as kabīne ar papildus sānu sienām. Labi iederas telpās, kur blakus kabīnei plānots.</span></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/Sima_schema.jpg\" style=\"font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/Pasikeliantis_mechanizmas.gif\" width=\"110\" height=\"73\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"\" /></a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/Sima_schema.jpg\" style=\"font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/Sima_schema.jpg\" width=\"119\" height=\"100\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" alt=\"\" /></a></p>","MILDA (Baltijos Brasta)":"<p><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/milda.jpg\" width=\"87\" height=\"130\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" alt=\"\" />&nbsp;<img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/Milda_sch.jpg\" width=\"115\" height=\"100\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; text-align: center;\">Bidamas duskabines ir klasika. Tas ir erts un stiligs dusas risinajums. Tas ir ipasi noderigas, ja ipasi trukst vietas&nbsp;</span></p>","SIMONA  (Baltijos Brasta)":"<p><span style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/simona.jpg\" width=\"87\" height=\"130\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" alt=\"\" /><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/simona_m.png\" width=\"127\" height=\"130\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"\" />Loti praktisks risinajums mazakam vannasistabam &ndash; dusas durvis var pieklaut sienai, kad kabine netiek izmantota. Vairak vietas un komforta. Turklat &ndash; udens maisitaju var ierikot ierastaja vieta.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","VESTA (Baltijos Brasta)":"<p><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/vesta.jpg\" width=\"87\" height=\"130\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" alt=\"\" />&nbsp;<img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/Vesta_sch.jpg\" width=\"96\" height=\"100\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; text-align: center;\">Bidamas duskabines ir klasika. Tas ir erts un stiligs dusas risinajums. Tas ir ipasi noderigas, ja ipasi trukst vietas&nbsp;</span></p>"}}